## Inline formatting

A paragraph with **bold**, *italic*, ~~strikethrough~~ and `inline code`. Marks can be combined: ***bold italic***, **bold with `code`**, and *~~italic strikethrough~~*.

Links can point to [another page on this site](/about/) or to [an external site](https://keystatic.com "Keystatic website").

This line ends with a hard break (Shift+Enter in the editor)\
so this text starts on a new line in the same paragraph.

## Lists

An unordered list:

- First item
- Second item with **bold** text
  - Nested item
  - Another nested item
    - A third level
- Third item

An ordered list:

1. Step one
2. Step two
   1. Sub-step A
   2. Sub-step B
3. Step three

## Blockquote

> A blockquote can hold *formatted* text and [links](/contact/).
>
> It can also span more than one paragraph.

## Code block

```js
// A fenced code block with a language set
export function greet(name) {
  return `Hello, ${name}!`;
}
```

```
A code block with no language.
```

